Tracking your credits

As an Enterprise account admin, you can monitor credit usage anytime in your Billing overview dashboard:

1. Navigate to Billing
2. Select the Current included usage tile
3. Click More details

About your credits

Credits are valid through <%= @credit_expiry_date %> and apply to metered products enabled on the Enterprise account submitted in your application, including:

- GitHub Enterprise licenses
- GitHub Copilot Business or Enterprise (including premium features)
- GitHub Advanced Security
- Add-ons such as Larger Runners and Codespaces

Once credits are fully consumed—or once the 12-month program period ends—billing will automatically transition to the payment method on file. At that time, standard rates will apply to any active products.

